```gitattributes
# ================================
# Line Endings
# ================================

# All text files use LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# Python
*.py text eol=lf
*.pyw text eol=lf
*.pyi text eol=lf

# Configuration
*.json text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.ini text eol=lf
*.cfg text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.env text eol=lf

# Documentation
*.md text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.rst text eol=lf

# Web
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf

# Shell
*.sh text eol=lf

# SQL
*.sql text eol=lf

# ================================
# Binary Files
# ================================

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.bmp binary

*.pdf binary

*.zip binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.7z binary

*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# ================================
# Project / Git
# ================================

.gitattributes text eol=lf
.gitignore text eol=lf
```

你的 Python 專案核心就是這一行：

```gitattributes
* text=auto eol=lf
```

搭配你 VS Code 的：

```json
"files.eol": "\n"
```

就可以確保：

**VS Code → LF → Git → LF**

如果你目前 Git 裡已經有一些檔案是 CRLF，再執行：

```bash
git add --renormalize .
git status
```

確認變更後再 commit。
